&lt;p&gt;📸 Add barcode scanning to your web app using &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191254/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;STRICH&lt;/a&gt;, a lean JS SDK. &lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191254/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;Free 14-day trial, try the demo app today!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191255/rss" style=" color: #D94306; font-weight: 600;"&gt;Don’t just code—grow as a technologist&lt;/a&gt; - Explore new technology, sharpen your existing skills and build new ones when you work in tech at Fidelity.&lt;/p&gt;
