&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 400 !important; font-size: 1.3em !important; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://frontendfoc.us/link/191256/rss" title="lab.ishadeed.com" style=" color: #D94306;"&gt;Gradient Visualizer: Debug Multi-Layer CSS Gradients&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — Paste a &lt;code&gt;background&lt;/code&gt; value made up of gradients and Ahmad's new tool pulls each layer apart so you can inspect it alone, view the stack in 3D, replay it as a timelapse, edit it and get fresh code back.&lt;/p&gt;
